enter"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1123221-i20260520-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-a-14","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1123221-i20260520","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1123221","date":"2026-05-20","original_code":"746.501(a)(14)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-06-23","finding":"Written Operational Policies - Transportation: During an investigation, it was determined the operation's transportation policy did not include what steps the operation would take when a child is not present during afterschool pick up. The policy also did not include parent notification of transportation pick up.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026562063","facility_name":"La Mision Child Care and Kid Kamp"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1525995-i20260319-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-a-14","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1525995-i20260319","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1525995","date":"2026-03-19","original_code":"746.501(a)(14)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-03-26","finding":"Written Operational Policies - Transportation: The operational policies were missing the required policies: Transportation, water activities, promotion of indoor and outdoor physical activity, procedures for providing and applying, as needed, insect repellant and sunscreen, Instructions on how a parent may access the: (Minimum standards online Texas Abuse and Neglect Hotline, HHSC website.), and you must also inform the parents that any area within 1,000 feet of a child-care center is a gang-free zone","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026493220","facility_name":"Little Tiger's Academy of Rockport"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1515066-i20250923-v10","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-a-14","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1515066-i20250923","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1515066","date":"2025-09-23","original_code":"746.501(a)(14)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-10-14","finding":"Written Operational Policies - Transportation: There was no transportation policy stated in the operational policies. The operation does offer transportation.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026409631","facility_name":"Joyful Days Academy"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1514831-i20250922-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-a-14","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1514831-i20250922","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-1514831","date":"2025-09-22","original_code":"746.501(a)(14)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-10-01","finding":"Written Operational Policies - Transportation: The operational policies do not include the policy regarding transportation which is provided.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026485766","facility_name":"Little Texans Academy of Allen, INC."},{"id":"tx-hhsc-264561-i20250728-v7","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-a-14","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-264561-i20250728","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-264561","date":"2025-07-28","original_code":"746.501(a)(14)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-08-11","finding":"Written Operational Policies - Transportation: In the operation policies it was missing the transportation section. Also, It was missing the unassigned epinepherine auto injector section and parent rights. It was missing more detail for physical activity.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026497591","facility_name":"Kids Palace Learning Center"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20250717-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-a-14","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-151975-i20250717","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-151975","date":"2025-07-17","original_code":"746.501(a)(14)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-09-15","finding":"Written Operational Policies - Transportation: The operation has a strong written transportation emergency preparedness plan which includes procedures for restroom emergencies while in transport. However, the policies were not followed as there were no planned restroom stops for a field trip that was about an hour and a half drive away. The policies also were not followed when a child urgently had to go to the bathroom. While information gathered in the investigation indicated staff could not pull over at the time due to stand still traffic, they also did not follow their policies by pulling over when they safely could as the child ended up going on the bus as they were unable to hold it. While the parents were notified of the incident and all parents notified of arrival at the center being delayed from the field trip due to traffic, the director was not notified immediately of the restroom emergency by staff which is in their policies.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026683779","facility_name":"Tomorrow's Promise"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-704988-i20250416-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-a-14","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-704988-i20250416","facility_id":"tx-hhsc-704988","date":"2025-04-16","original_code":"746.501(a)(14)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","severity_rank":1,"source_category":"Medium","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2025-05-05","finding":"Written Operational Policies - Transportation: Upon reviewing the operational policies, the policy for transportation was not addressed.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026330372","facility_name":"Hart to Hart Learning Center"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1494508-i20250203-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-501-a-14","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1494508-i20250203","f